# Figure 58, far-field gain of the Luneberg lens antenna: the steps of examples/Luneberg.jou (cosine beam,
# 128-point grid for INT at 16, 64-point grid for GAIN at 17) with the COLUMN plot type and the center column
# 129 -- the pattern in dB.  Pages: 0 the INT plot, 1 the gain map, 2 the column cut (the figure).
# COPY: $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/examples/Luneberg.in fig58
# DEADLINE: 300
cd $TMP/fig58
old Luneberg.in
pgd
/png
beam
cos
0.875
1.5
mod
nGridPts=128
q
int 16
mod
nGridPts=64
q
gain 17
col
gain 17
129
gain 17
129
! mkdir -p $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/build/figs/fig58; cp $TMP/fig58/giza_*.png $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/build/figs/fig58/
# EXPECT: Maximum gain= 3\.16146\d+D\+01
# EXPECT: Plot type set to COLUMN
# EXPECT-NOT: forrtl
